{"candidateAnswer":"2019","evidence":"[D5:6 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Sam: It looks like your kids are having a great time! And how long have you been prioritizing your health?\n[D5:7 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Yes, they bring me such joy. My healthy road has been a long one. I've been working on it for two years now, so there have been ups and downs, but I'm doing my best.","itemId":"urn:uuid:1c53f79b-287a-5324-a949-112744b84891","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a644044079bc246357c97c066edfbe3f05446f629a7d38532ed909a01d15829b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which year did Evan start taking care of his health seriously?","referenceAnswer":"2021","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a644044079bc246357c97c066edfbe3f05446f629a7d38532ed909a01d15829b"}}]}